<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</title>
<headline>Ecuador's coffee export prices detailed.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the</p>
<p>minimum FOB reference prices for export of a 100-pound (45.36</p>
<p>kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean coffee, effective from February 20</p>
<p>to February 26, 1997.</p>
<p>	 Washed arabic....................$ 159.21</p>
<p>	 Natural arabic...................$ 151.43</p>
<p>	 Robust natural...................$  59.10</p>
<p>	 Roasted and/or ground............$ 125.27</p>
</text>
